<body>
    <h1>Azure Synapse Link</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"1dd5a28af6ee"><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro ji=
ra-issue" data-jira-key=3D"MATT-15253"> <a href=3D"https://wrberkley.atlass=
ian.net/browse/MATT-15253" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=
=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/i=
ssuetype/avatar/10615?size=3Dmedium">MATT-15253</a> - <span class=3D"summar=
y">Data Feed: Provision Azure Synapse Link for Dynamics 365 CRM</span> <spa=
n class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-current jira-macro-si=
ngle-issue-export-pdf">IN REVIEW</span> </span></p>
<p local-id=3D"ed14a781559e">Azure Synapse Link for Dynamics 365 continuous=
ly replicates selected Dynamics 365/Dataverse tables to Azure Data Lake Sto=
rage Gen2 as analytics-ready Delta Lake (Parquet) datasets, enabling near r=
eal-time reporting, data engineering, and AI workloads without impacting th=
e source application.</p>
<p local-id=3D"37b2f152e5b1">&nbsp;High level engineering tasks, to be furt=
her developed as part of the POC.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2ead8ba9-2632-4ac5-ba4f-b1db8a8e9426">
<li local-id=3D"996ac3bd-26a8-41cc-b366-bae76224cc7a">
<p local-id=3D"ad974852de06">Provision isolated dev Azure Data Lake Storage=
 Gen2 for the POC</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c99a4254-79b9-4830-8e33-75e1e0b1e360">
<p local-id=3D"090ebf88a441">Configure the specialized managed identity for=
 Dataverse to communicate with Azure Storage using the Microsoft backbone</=
p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"60dcf12c-9164-4535-9f1d-ce0a9a792e80">
<p local-id=3D"2404445be5a1">Configure the dev Storage Account to allow com=
munication with the Export to Data Lake service</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c315b539-3d52-49a5-8c49-4516202f7947">
<p local-id=3D"b7e9f1a43316">Test and validate the export process with the =
ESTech Data and D365 Teams</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"af5d8b28d5b7" id=3D"AzureSynapseLink-DeploymentConsideratio=
ns">Deployment Considerations</h3>
<p local-id=3D"cd0f7607dc78"><a data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"htt=
ps://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/x/jYBrhQ" local-id=3D"c6134ab24659" rel=
=3D"nofollow">https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/x/jYBrhQ</a></p>
