<h3 local-id=3D"a4cd0052ca2c" id=3D"AzureSynapseLink-ConfigurationAccounts:=
">Configuration Accounts:</h3>
<p local-id=3D"994fd3416271">The following service accounts have been added=
 to the AD group and should have access to the required Azure resources to =
configure a link.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f4d7a96ef676">AD Group: <strong>ACL-DNA-helix_dataversexport=
_O</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3d86045-f6d0-4059-8107-3e55195d4a34">
<li local-id=3D"7d366d21-29d9-4d7d-aa3c-6b5733b48ae4">
<p local-id=3D"2cc76803265c">Dynamics Dev : <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"mailto:svc-ent-r-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com" rel=3D"nofollow">svc=
-ent-d-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com</a></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ee638f68-8011-4ed5-9b74-ecd77b806f66">
<p local-id=3D"301dc5add2dd">Dynamics TST: <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"mailto:svc-ent-t-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com" rel=3D"nofollow">svc=
-ent-t-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com</a></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"8ce9f4ff-003d-4995-a911-79ae275e9e0f">
<p local-id=3D"089e05c7931c">Dynamics UAT: <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"mailto:svc-ent-s-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com" rel=3D"nofollow">svc=
-ent-s-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com</a></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0e573913-fc4a-4ec6-b5b6-7b0b2fd2435a">
<p local-id=3D"4791ced94724">Dynamics PROD: <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"mailto:svc-ent-v-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com" rel=3D"nofollow">svc=
-ent-v-pwpdyn02@wrbts.ads.wrberkley.com</a></p>
