ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"11" data-media-id=3D"dde8934b-f14a=
-41a0-b945-b95bae3d470b" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"531"></span>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f6675d5a19db">
<li local-id=3D"a8ece9c1-c743-4d10-803d-05c9e1131bc4">
<p local-id=3D"d02d7efaf1f3">On the command bar, select <strong>+ New link =
to data lake</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"2c8b50e3-55c7-402c-91b1-98ec8efc5e57">
<p local-id=3D"40684e70e803">Select the <strong>Subscription</strong>, <str=
ong>Resource group</strong>, and <strong>Storage account</strong>. Ensure t=
hat storage account meets the requirements specified in the <a class=3D"ext=
ernal-link" href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-apps/maker/data=
-platform/azure-synapse-link-data-lake#prerequisites" rel=3D"nofollow">Prer=
equisites</a> section. Select <strong>Next</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c995c83a6336">Note</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"335f384c7464">
<li local-id=3D"68cf1f213e2a">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"921a78c3253c">
<li local-id=3D"2eba132f87d5">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"33e8458b4ae1">
<li local-id=3D"f586c247e0b0">
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"18c909d66381">
<li local-id=3D"7847c2272959">
<p local-id=3D"a4557a5d281b"><em><strong>Dev - Sub-dna-dv2</strong></em></p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"8407a9970b24">
<p local-id=3D"07d18f512e0d"><em><strong>Test - Sub-dna-it1</strong></em></=
p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3915a5754e2e">
<p local-id=3D"b536207fa14a"><em><strong>UAT - Sub-dna-tt2</strong></em></p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0fbcb3ead3b5">
<p local-id=3D"cd9eb1d7b0c7"><em><strong>Prod - Sub-dna-pd2</strong></em></=
p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
